        "edit": "Add the missing else branch so that when s==1 the output y is assigned b, completing the 2:1 mux and correcting the inverted/incomplete select polarity.",
        "lens_id": "generic_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module mux21(a,b,s,y);\n\tinput a,b,s;\n\toutput y;\n\treg y;\n\talways @(a,b,s)\n\t\tif(s==1'B0)begin y=a;end\n\t\telse begin y=b;end\nendmodule",
